                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-900 flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <span>🧩 Memahami Nilai Tempat (Ratusan, Puluhan, Satuan)</span>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600">Setiap angka pada bilangan 3-angka memiliki nilai tergantung posisinya.</p>
                    
                    <div class="bg-indigo-50 border-2 border-indigo-200 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
                        <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-indigo-900 mb-4 tracking-widest">
                            <span class="text-blue-600 border-b-4 border-blue-500 px-2">4</span>
                            <span class="text-emerald-600 border-b-4 border-emerald-500 px-2">5</span>
                            <span class="text-pink-600 border-b-4 border-pink-500 px-2">7</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 md:gap-4 font-bold text-sm md:text-base">
                            <div class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 p-3 rounded-xl border border-blue-300">
                                <div class="text-2xl mb-1">🟦</div>
                                <div>4 RATUSAN</div>
                                <div class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-normal">(400)</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-300">
                                <div class="text-2xl mb-1">🟩</div>
                                <div>5 PULUHAN</div>
                                <div class="text-xs text-emerald-600 font-normal">(50)</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-pink-100 text-pink-800 p-3 rounded-xl border border-pink-300">
                                <div class="text-2xl mb-1">🟪</div>
                                <div>7 SATUAN</div>
                                <div class="text-xs text-pink-600 font-normal">(7)</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-amber-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 text-amber-900 text-sm">
                        <b>💡 Ringkasan:</b> 457 = 400 + 50 + 7. Saat melakukan pengurangan, selalu selesaikan dari <b>SATUAN</b> terlebih dahulu, lalu <b>PULUHAN</b>, lalu <b>RATUSAN</b>!
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Sub-Materi Content 2 -->
                <div id="submateri-2" class="submateri-content hidden space-y-6">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-900">➖ Pengurangan Tanpa Meminjam</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600">Pengurangan ini dilakukan jika setiap angka pembilang lebih besar dari angka penyebut.</p>
                    
                    <div class="bg-emerald-50 border-2 border-emerald-200 rounded-2xl p-6 max-w-md mx-auto">
                        <div class="text-center font-heading text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900 mb-4">Contoh: 568 - 234 = ...</div>
                        <div class="font-mono text-2xl text-right max-w-xs mx-auto space-y-1 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-inner border border-emerald-300">
                            <div class="tracking-widest">5 6 8</div>
                            <div class="tracking-widest border-b-2 border-slate-800 pb-1">- 2 3 4</div>
                            <div class="font-bold text-emerald-600 tracking-widest pt-1">3 3 4</div>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="mt-4 text-xs md:text-sm text-emerald-800 space-y-1 pl-4 list-disc">
                            <li><b>Satuan:</b> 8 - 4 = 4</li>
                            <li><b>Puluhan:</b> 6 - 3 = 3</li>
                            <li><b>Ratusan:</b> 5 - 2 = 3</li>
                            <li><b>Hasil Akhir:</b> 334</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Sub-Materi Content 3 -->
                <div id="submateri-3" class="submateri-content hidden space-y-6">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-900">🔄 Pengurangan Dengan Meminjam (Re-grouping)</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600">Jika angka satuan/puluhan atas lebih kecil dari bawah, kita harus meminjam 1 puluhan dari sebelahnya!</p>
                    
                    <div class="bg-purple-50 border-2 border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">
                        <div class="text-center font-heading text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-4">Contoh: 452 - 178 = ...</div>
                        
                        <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-purple-900">
                            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200 flex items-start space-x-3">
                                <span class="bg-purple-600 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">1</span>
                                <div>
                                    <b>Langkah Satuan (2 - 8):</b> Karena 2 &lt; 8, pinjam 1 puluhan dari 5. Angka 2 menjadi <b>12</b>, dan angka 5 puluhan tersisa <b>4</b>.<br>
                                    <span class="text-purple-700 font-bold">12 - 8 = 4</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200 flex items-start space-x-3">
                                <span class="bg-purple-600 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">2</span>
                                <div>
                                    <b>Langkah Puluhan (4 - 7):</b> Karena 4 &lt; 7, pinjam 1 ratusan dari 4. Angka 4 menjadi <b>14</b>, dan angka 4 ratusan tersisa <b>3</b>.<br>
                                    <span class="text-purple-700 font-bold">14 - 7 = 7</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200 flex items-start space-x-3">
                                <span class="bg-purple-600 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">3</span>
                                <div>
                                    <b>Langkah Ratusan (3 - 1):</b><br>
                                    <span class="text-purple-700 font-bold">3 - 1 = 2</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="text-center mt-4 bg-purple-200 text-purple-950 p-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg">
                            Hasil Akhir: 274
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Sub-Materi Content 4 -->
                <div id="submateri-4" class="submateri-content hidden space-y-6">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-900">📖 Memahami Soal Cerita Matematika</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600">Tips membedakan kapan harus memakai penjumlahan atau pengurangan:</p>
                    
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div class="bg-emerald-50 border-2 border-emerald-200 rounded-2xl p-4">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-emerald-900 flex items-center space-x-2 mb-2">
                                <span>➕ Penjumlahan</span>
                            </h4>
                            <p class="text-xs text-emerald-800 mb-2">Kata kunci dalam soal:</p>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 text-xs">
                                <span class="bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-900 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold">Membeli lagi</span>
                                <span class="bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-900 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold">Diberi tambahan</span>
                                <span class="bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-900 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold">Jumlah seluruhnya</span>
                                <span class="bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-900 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold">Gabungan</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-rose-50 border-2 border-rose-200 rounded-2xl p-4">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-rose-900 flex items-center space-x-2 mb-2">
                                <span>➖ Pengurangan</span>
                            </h4>
                            <p class="text-xs text-rose-800 mb-2">Kata kunci dalam soal:</p>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 text-xs">
                                <span class="bg-rose-200 text-rose-900 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold">Sisa</span>
                                <span class="bg-rose-200 text-rose-900 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold">Dimakan/Rusak</span>
                                <span class="bg-rose-200 text-rose-900 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold">Selisih</span>
                                <span class="bg-rose-200 text-rose-900 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold">Diberikan kepada</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. SIMULASI INTERAKTIF (LABORATORIUM BLOK 1000) -->
        <section id="sec-simulasi" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-md border-2 border-slate-100">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-3 mb-6">
